  "subtitle": "Use y (and), o (or), pero (but) and porque (because) to join words and sentences. Before an i- sound, y becomes e. Before an o- sound, o becomes u. Use también and tampoco to say “also” and “not either”.",
  "briefMarks": ["y", "e", "o", "u", "pero", "porque", "también", "tampoco"],
